            "notes": "[Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) = melting. Thats all you need in the early rounds. Although if you are going to play roughly or they have a tank that plays with much agression, like [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49). \n\n---\n\nAlthough you can use [Shadow Step](ability_3b562720-e8e8-48d4-b0fc-42bef6557322) to flank. But because the tank is very chunky, I recommend to shoot it to power [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51). But if you are good at shooting with [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457), go for flanking.",
